  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "How did a five-thousand-to-one shot win the Premier League?",
      "scene": {
        "type": "odds",
        "hook": true,
        "bg": "blue",
        "title": "BET SLIP",
        "pick": "LEICESTER CITY",
        "market": "TO WIN THE PREMIER LEAGUE",
        "to": 5000,
        "foot": "AUGUST 2015"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In August 2015, that's what the bookmakers thought of Leicester City.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "odds",
        "bg": "blue",
        "cut": true,
        "title": "BET SLIP",
        "pick": "LEICESTER CITY",
        "market": "TO WIN THE PREMIER LEAGUE",
        "to": 5000,
        "foot": "AUGUST 2015"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And fair enough. The season before, they were bottom at Christmas.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "table",
        "bg": "navy",
        "title": "PREMIER LEAGUE · CHRISTMAS 2014",
        "rows": [
          {
            "pos": 20,
            "name": "Leicester City",
            "pts": "",
            "hi": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Then they hired Claudio Ranieri.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "ranieri",
          "hairStyle": "slick",
          "hair": "#cfcac2"
        },
        "name": "CLAUDIO RANIERI"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His team sat deep, and hit you on the break.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "press",
        "bg": "green",
        "won": "ON THE BREAK"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Jamie Vardy scored in eleven league games in a row. A Premier League record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "vardy"
        },
        "name": "VARDY · 11 GAMES IN A ROW"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "N'Golo Kanté seemed to be everywhere at once.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "kante",
          "hairStyle": "short"
        },
        "name": "N'GOLO KANTÉ"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And Riyad Mahrez was named the PFA Player of the Year.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "portrait",
        "bg": "blue",
        "person": {
          "image": "mahrez",
          "hairStyle": "short"
        },
        "name": "RIYAD MAHREZ"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "On the second of May, Tottenham drew at Chelsea, and Leicester were champions.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "fixture",
        "bg": "blue",
        "now": {
          "top": "2 MAY 2016",
          "teams": "CHELSEA 2-2 SPURS",
          "foot": "LEICESTER ARE CHAMPIONS"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Eighty-one points. Ten clear.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "table",
        "bg": "navy",
        "title": "PREMIER LEAGUE 2015/16",
        "rows": [
          {
            "pos": 1,
            "name": "Leicester City",
            "pts": 81,
            "hi": true
          },
          {
            "pos": 2,
            "name": "Arsenal",
            "pts": 71
          },
          {
            "pos": 3,
            "name": "Tottenham",
            "pts": 70
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Five thousand to one.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "picture",
        "image": "leicesterfans",
        "bg": "blue",
        "label": "CHAMPIONS · 5,000/1"
      }
    }
  ]
}